{"3465310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retronika", "steam_appid": 3465310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop on your <strong>hoverbike</strong> and go guns blazing in this story-driven single-player experience! This <strong>is Retronika and it’s time to fight back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through <strong>chaotic traffic and vibrant cityscapes,</strong> face off against towering metallic bosses, and drones, and prove who’s truly in charge in <strong>Retronika</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Expect Chaotic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in high-speed battles, taking down drones and enemy vehicles as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/fac1dca209f39a5b617f4b0090bc141f.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Master Your Hoverbike Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full control of your hoverbike while fighting through and <strong>master your movement to survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Planet Retronika, a once-friendly world that has now turned <strong>hostile</strong>, and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of your hoverbike with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and <strong>personalize it</strong> with different customizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_gam