daba8b94976b681203d8d8d7f45275fb.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into Planet Retronika, a once-friendly world that has now turned <strong>hostile</strong>, and uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/b80e19b62491c4a5a9cbee06c9561c4a.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >    Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the most out of your hoverbike with <strong>powerful upgrades</strong> and <strong>personalize it</strong> with different customizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.poster.avif?t=1762887617\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.webm?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465310/extras/1db6633ae3d1c8cc3ec4b051c8f9fe66.mp4?t=1762887617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Hop on your hoverbike and dive into Retronika, an immersive VR adventure! Fight challenging enemies, master 3D movement and shooting, and navigate vi